t finals. The search results contain match data from both a Summer Super Cup Finals BO5 and a Season Finals BO5, showing both teams have won games against each other. GSMC demonstrates strong individual player performance with high KDA ratios and farming efficiency, while TP shows competitive team-level statistics. Game 2 specific outcomes vary between the two tournament instances referenced.", "side_yes_case": ["GSMC's Vaynedeta maintains elite KDA of 9.9 overall with consistent high performance (12.0-12.6 KDA in multiple Game 2s)", "GSMC won both Game 2 matchups shown in search results with strong objective control and mid-game execution", "GSMC achieved 2186 GPM in tournament, matching TP's best, demonstrating economic efficiency to close games", "GSMC's mid laner Peppe and ADC Vaynedeta rank among tournament's best (6.2 and 9.9 KDA respectively)"], "side_no_case": ["TP won Game 2 in Summer Super Cup Finals with 30:11 stomp, demonstrating ability to execute cleanly against GSMC", "TP's support Centu achieved 1.84 WPM in that victory, showing strong vision control and playmaking", "TP reached Season Finals as well, indicating sustained competitive viability in head-to-head matchups", "GSMC's support REAVER shows defensive weaknesses with low KDA (2.0-4.8) and high deaths (11-14) in Game 2s"], "key_context": ["Multiple tournament instances in search results create ambiguity about which specific Game 2 is being predicted", "Both teams competed in HLL 2025 Summer Super Cup Finals and Season Finals tournaments", "Fearless Draft format was used, affecting champion availability and team composition strategy", "Average game duration of 33:54 suggests mid-game excellence and decisive play matter more than scaling", "TP vs GSMC head-to-head shows competitive series with victories split between teams across tournament finals"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-07T14:27:05.214727Z"}}, "resolution": {"resolved_at": "2026-04-07T17:00:00Z", "winning_side": "NO", "final_yes_price": 0.