.2% | 17.3% |\n| JUNGLE | 19.6% | 13.1% |\n| MID | 21.4% | 31.4% |\n| ADC | 25.9% | 30.4% |\n| SUPPORT | 11% | 7.7% |\n\n| Vision |\n\n|  |\n\n| Jungle share |\n\n| CS killed in team jungle + CS killed in enemy jungle |\n\nInstagram Games of Legends\nPatreon Games of Legends\nBluesky Games of Legends\nFacebook Games of Legends\nX Bynjee", "Misa Esports\n\n| Date |  | Tournament | Score | | vs."], "news_summary": "EMEA Masters 2026 Winter is an ongoing A-Tier tournament running through April 21, 2026. Misa Esports maintains an 80% win rate (8-2 record) in group play, while Berlin International Gaming (BIG) has a 71% win rate (15-6 record) overall. Recent head-to-head data shows Misa Esports defeated Otter Side 2-0 on March 13, while BIG lost to Otter Side 0-2 on the same date. Both teams are competing in the tournament with different bracket positions and recent trajectories.", "side_yes_case": ["Misa Esports has a superior win rate of 80% compared to BIG's 71% in the tournament", "Recent direct evidence shows Misa Esports defeated OTS 2-0 while BIG lost to OTS 0-2 on March 13", "Misa Esports maintains strong performance with 8 wins against only 2 losses in group stage", "Misa Esports shows better gold differential per minute (+192 GPM) indicating stronger macro play"], "side_no_case": ["BIG has more total wins (15) in the tournament despite lower win rate, suggesting deeper tournament run", "BIG's 71% win rate is still very strong performance in competitive environment", "BIG defeated S2G 2-1 on March 11 showing recent positive results in group play", "Tournament bracket position and seeding may favor BIG's playoff trajectory"], "key_context": ["This is EMEA Masters 2026 Winter, an A-Tier online tournament running March 9 - April 21, 2026", "Match is Game 1 of what appears to be a playoff series format", "BIG was in Lower Bracket Quarterfinals on April 7, suggesting different bracket positions", "Both teams are European representatives competing in group stage/playo