ger preparation or roster depth than market assumes."}, {"agent_name": "The Base-Rate Statistician", "probability": 0.5, "confidence_yes": 0.25, "confidence_no": 0.25, "rationale": "\u2022 CRITICAL DATA GAP: Briefing contains VALORANT tournament data for Misa Esports (VCL T\u00fcrkiye/EMEA), not League of Legends performance metrics\n\u2022 NO LoL ROSTER INFORMATION: Misa Esports' LoL team composition, recent form, or competitive standing in EMEA Masters 2026 not provided\n\u2022 BIG TEAM ABSENT: Zero information on BIG's LoL roster, strength, recent performance, or head-to-head history vs Misa\n\u2022 NO DIRECT PRECEDENT: No historical match data between these teams in LoL provided\n\u2022 TOURNAMENT CONTEXT INCOMPLETE: Playoff seeding, bracket position, recent match results for both teams in EMEA Masters not available\n\u2022 TIME-TO-REVERSAL RISK: Event resolves in ~5 hours (TODAY timing); insufficient time for new information to surface; market may already reflect live odds or insider knowledge\n\u2022 MARKET PRICE ASSESSMENT: 58% YES / 42% NO suggests modest favorite on Misa side, but without underlying data, cannot validate this divergence from base rate\n\u2022 SYMMETRICAL IGNORANCE: Both sides of confidence equally compromised; lack of counter-evidence is not evidence for either outcome\n\u2022 DEFAULT TO COIN FLIP: With zero actionable differentiation between teams and absent LoL performance data, genuine 50-50 assessment required\n\u2022 CONFIDENCE SEVERELY LIMITED: Unable to construct reliable probability model; setting both confidence scores to 25 to reflect comprehensive data insufficiency on both YES and NO sides", "key_factor": "Lower bracket semifinal match outcomes in LoL tournaments are approximately 50-50 without team-specific data; no reliable historical base rate for Misa Esports vs BIG LoL matchup exists"}, {"agent_name": "The Sentiment Analyst", "probability": 0.5, "confidence_yes": 0.2, "confidence_no": 0.2, "rationale": "CRITICAL DATA GAP: Briefing contains VALORANT performance data for Misa Esports, not League of Legends data. The provided match history (VCL T\u00fcrkiye/EMEA) is irrelevant to LoL EMEA Masters prediction. BIG TEAM COMPLETELY ABSENT: Zero information provided about BIG's LoL roster, recent form, or competitive standing in EMEA Masters 2026. NO HEAD-TO-HEAD HISTORY: No direct match records between Misa Esports and BIG in LoL provided. NO EMEA MASTERS LoL DATA: Briefing fails to include Misa Esports' actual LoL tournament performance, playoff seeding, recent win/loss record, or roster composition in EMEA Masters. MARKET PRICE (58/42) APPEARS ARBITRARY: Current 58% YES odds suggest modest confidence in Misa, but this cannot be validated against briefing data\u2014price likely reflects community sentiment rather than informed analysis. EVENT TIMING PRESSURE: Match resolves TODAY (~5 hours). Low time to reversal means shares will likely trade toward extremes ($0.01/$0.99) once result becomes clear, regardless of pre-match reasoning. ASYMMETRIC CONFIDENCE REQUIRED: Cannot justify high confidence on either side due to complete absence of LoL-specific data for both teams. Both YES and NO confidence must remain very low. MARKET FUNCTIONING ON BLIND SENTIMENT: 58% YES pricing in a $54.8k volume market appears driven by crowd psychology or historical bias toward Misa brand, not substantive competitive intelligence.", "key_factor": "Apathy"}, {"agent_name": "The Domain Specialist", "probability": 0.5, "confidence_yes": 0.25, "confidence_no": 0.25, "rationale": "CRITICAL DATA MISMATCH: All performance data provided is from VCL T\u00fcrkiye and VCL EMEA (VALORANT competitions), not League of Legends EMEA Masters. Game-specific competence gaps: VALORANT roster performance has zero predictive value for LoL competitive outcomes\u2014different game mechanics, agent pools, team compositions, and meta entirely. NO LoL roster information: Briefing provides no LoL roster names, player identities, recent LoL match results, or team composition data for either Misa Esports or BIG. COMPLETE absence of BIG data: Zero information on BIG's LoL team strength, recent form, head-to-head history, or roster composition. No direct head-to-head history: Zero BoX records between Misa and BIG in LoL available in briefing. Tournament context insufficient: EMEA Masters 2026 Winter structure, seeding information, and Misa's actual LoL playoff positioning unknown. Market price (58% YES / 42% NO) reflects genuine information asymmetry in the broader market, not analyst confidence based on available data. EVENT TIMING (TODAY, ~5 hours to match): Given imminent resolution, price convergence suggests market traders have access to team form data external to this briefing. Confidence symmetrically LOW on both sides due to complete absence of relevant competitive intelligence\u2014cannot evaluate either team's LoL capability.", "key_factor": "The briefing conflates VALORANT tournament data (VCL) with a League of Legends EMEA Masters match, rendering all provided performance metrics irrelevant to the LoL matchup in question."}, {"agent_name": "The Contrarian", "probability": 0.45, "confidence_yes": 0.25, "confidence_no": 0.25, "rationale": "CRITICAL DATA VOID: Briefing contains only VALORANT statistics for Misa Esports (VCL T\u00fcrkiye/EMEA), not League of Legends data. No LoL roster, recent form, or EMEA Masters performance for either team is provided. BIG TEAM COMPLETELY ABSENT: Zero information on BIG's LoL roster, recent results, strength tier, or head-to-head history vs Misa. Cannot assess their competitive standing or meta alignment. NO DIRECT MATCHUP HISTORY: Zero head-to-head LoL results between Misa Esports and BIG provided. Cannot establish empirical advantage either direction. MARKET PRICE SIGNAL (58% YES) SUGGESTS MISA SLIGHT FAVORITE: Current odds imply modest confidence in Misa, but this may reflect general tournament seeding/bracket position rather than form-based analysis. LIVE/IMMINENT TIMING (5 HOURS TO RESOLUTION): Any roster disruption, player illness, or tactical surprise must occur or be revealed within the next few hours\u2014plausible but time-constrained. BO3 FORMAT AMPLIFIES VARIANCE: Best-of-three eliminates flukes more than single games, but game 1 draft/mental state can cascade into series outcome; roster instability disproportionately impacts BO3. ABSENCE OF EMEA MASTERS LoL DATA IS THE BLIND SPOT: Neither team's recent LoL performance in THIS tournament (March 9\u2013April 21) is documented. Both could be overseeded or underseeded relative to market price. CONFLICTING TOURNAMENT CONTEXT: Misa Esports shown playing VCL T\u00fcrkiye on April 4\u20136 (recent, multiple matches). If Misa is juggling dual-tournament obligations, fatigue/scheduling strain could suppress their LoL preparation or player focus. PLAUSIBLE BLACK SWAN: Roster sub, player illness, or late tactical pivot by underdog BIG to exploit unknown meta read in Misa's recent scrim block\u2014impossible to detect without LoL-specific intelligence. CONFIDENCE CAPPED AT 25 EACH SIDE: Data asymmetry is extreme; neither YES nor NO can be confidently assessed. Market price of 58/42 may reflect institutional knowledge not in briefing, or may be mispriced due to data scarcity.", "key_factor": "One team fields a substitute mid-laner or experiences a critical roster swap due to illness/emergency immediately before the match, severely disrupting team synergy and macro execution in a BO3 format where game 1 pacing is critical."}], "final_score": 0.4902941176470588, "no_score": 0.5119642857142858, "edge": -0.09470588235294114, "no_edge": 0.09696428571428573, "recommendation": "PASS", "confidence_level": "LOW", "signal_type": null, "pass_reason": "Contrarian call: council prob 51% < 70% threshold; Contrarian call: NO-side confidence 24% < 80% threshold", "briefing": {"market": {"id": "1909348", "question": "LoL: Misa Esports vs BIG (BO3) - EMEA Masters Playoffs", "resolution_cri