orts' map count disadvantage (74-80) shows overall struggle in Stage 2", "Neither team has established clear dominance; statistical edge slightly favors Team Evictix"], "key_context": ["Swiss Stage format: 16 teams, BO3 matches, 4 wins required for playoff advancement", "Both teams currently 1-2 with similar remaining round distribution and playoff hopes", "No prior head-to-head record in data; match listed as 0-0 (pending or unplayed)", "Stage 2 running March 23 - April 22, 2026; exact match date not specified in results", "Limited individual player performance data available; roster includes SaD (stellar, welyy, Pa1nt, payne, zaj)"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-07T20:02:06.396018Z"}}, "resolution": null, "analysis": null}
