d-to-round competitiveness"], "key_context": ["Swiss format: Both teams are in the lower bracket (0-2 to 1-2 range) competing for playoff qualification at 4 wins", "All matches are best-of-three, with no head-to-head history provided in available data", "Tournament stage: Stage 2 group play occurring March 23-April 22, 2026; specific match date appears to be upcoming", "Both teams at critical juncture: further losses risk elimination from playoff contention", "16-team format with competitive field including stronger squads like FlyQuest, NRG Academy, and M80 ahead in standings"], "data_freshness": "2026-04-07T20:04:43.683023Z"}}, "resolution": null, "analysis": null}
